{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30385","headline":"送裴延翰下第归觐滁州 · 赵嘏","name":"送裴延翰下第归觐滁州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"失意何曾恨解携，问安归去秣陵西。\n郡斜杨柳春风岸，山映楼台明月溪。\n江上诗书悬素业，日边门户倚丹梯。\n一枝攀折回头是，莫向清秋惜马蹄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}